{"id":354,"date":"2019-12-24T12:12:40","date_gmt":"2019-12-24T11:12:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/strasbourgcarrelage.com\/?page_id=354"},"modified":"2020-03-31T17:02:37","modified_gmt":"2020-03-31T15:02:37","slug":"style-campagne-chic","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/styles\/style-campagne-chic\/","title":{"rendered":"Style campagne chic"},"content":{"rendered":"<section id=\"title-two-columns-block_5e0dfebb2d33c\" class=\"title-two-columns-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        \n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strasbourg Carrelage vous propose d\u2019adopter un int\u00e9rieur <\/span><b>cocooning<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> avec le carrelage campagne chic.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">G\u00e9n\u00e9ralement compos\u00e9 de<\/span><b> mat\u00e9riaux bruts<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, le carrelage campagne chic donnera un aspect <\/span><b>chaleureux<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et <\/span><b>accueillant<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00e0 votre d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Le carrelage campagne chic habille aussi bien les sols d\u2019un salon, que ceux d\u2019une cuisine ou encore d\u2019une chambre \u00e0 coucher.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ainsi, retrouvez le <\/span><b>confort d\u2019un weekend\u00a0 \u00e0 la campagne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> sans m\u00eame sortir de chez vous.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aussi, ce style se marie particuli\u00e8rement bien avec des meubles en bois, des objets de d\u00e9co romantiques ou rustiques. Il incarne charme, douceur et authenticit\u00e9.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Enfin carrelages qui sont g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement utilis\u00e9s dans le style campagne chic sont le <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/imitations\/imitation-bois\/\">carrelage imitation bois<\/a><\/strong> et le <a href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/imitations\/imitation-beton\/\"><strong>carrelage imitation b\u00e9ton<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strasbourg Carrelage est une entreprise familiale. Nous vous accompagnons dans vos projets de d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure en Alsace depuis plus de 17 ans. <\/span><b>Nous avons vendu plus d\u2019un million de m\u00e8tres carr\u00e9s de carrelage<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> dans le Grand Est.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aussi, nous vous aiderons \u00e0 concevoir vos projets, \u00e0 travers la compr\u00e9hension de vos <\/span><b>envies<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et de vos <\/span><b>besoins<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">,\u00a0 pour leur donner vie.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dans notre showroom situ\u00e9 \u00e0 Strasbourg, dans le Bas-Rhin, nous pourrons ainsi vous proposer <\/span><b>tous types de carrelage<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> style campagne chic. Nous vous accompagnerons dans votre projet de d\u00e9co.<\/span><\/p>\n\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"red-content-block_5e0dff882d33d\" class=\"red-content-block simple\" style=\"background-color: #8b0936\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n            \n                            <h3 class=\"big-title\"><span><p>Int\u00e9ress\u00e9(e) par l\u2019un de ces mod\u00e8les ?<\/p>\n<\/span><\/h3>\n            \n                            <div class=\"text\">\n                    <p>Vous recherchez un style particulier ? Vous souhaitez voir d\u2019autres carrelages de ce genre ?<br \/>\nContactez-nous, nous vous proposerons d\u2019autres produits, au meilleur prix !<\/p>\n\n                <\/div>\n            \n            \n                                                <p class=\"text-center\">\n                                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-white\" href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/contact\/\" title=\"Contactez-nous\">Contactez-nous<\/a>\n                            \n                    <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>D\u00e9couvrez notre collection carrelage style campagne chic, pour donner un aspect design et cocooning \u00e0 votre int\u00e9rieur, tout en b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiant des avantages qu\u2019offre le carrelage.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":362,"parent":216,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-354","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/354","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=354"}],"version-history":[{"count":20,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/354\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1007,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/354\/revisions\/1007"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/216"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/362"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=354"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}